-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §50 תקציב לקרן הלוואות: a further one-time
-- sum of 4 million shekels is allocated, by 31.12.2011, to the loan fund
-- set up under §יב of the collective agreement of 12.9.95 (imported).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `1995-09-12_oz-latmura_special-agreement-hashlama`

§ `50 תקציב לקרן הלוואות`

-- ¶1: to the loan fund set up under §יב of the collective agreement of
-- 12.9.95 (a fund for teaching employees who are not State employees) a
-- further one-time sum of 4 million is allocated, by 31.12.2011 (the day
-- included: convention dates.end). "יוקצה" names no one to allocate it, so
-- the encoding writes no duty for it, as §33 writes none to install the
-- clock: what it states is the sum and the day.
@ref akn:art_50/p1
`the further sum section 50 allocates to the loan fund` MEANS 4_000_000

`the day section 50's sum is allocated by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011

GIVEN `allocated on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 50's sum is allocated in time` `allocated on` IF
    `allocated on` `is on or before` `the day section 50's sum is allocated by`

-- The fund is §יב's (imported): 2 million shekels for the organisation's
-- members who are not State employees, its rules set by the Treasury's,
-- the Ministry's and the organisation's representatives (set elsewhere:
-- `why the loan fund's rules are not in §יב`, imported).
`the sum §יב of 12.9.95 set the loan fund up with` MEANS `the loan fund the 1995 Oz agreement sets up`

GIVEN `a member of the organisation` IS A BOOLEAN, `a State employee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the loan fund section 50 funds serves` `a member of the organisation` `a State employee` IF
    `may borrow from the 1995 Oz loan fund` `a member of the organisation` `a State employee`

#ASSERT `section 50's sum is allocated in time` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011)
#ASSERT NOT `section 50's sum is allocated in time` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012)
-- §50's further sum is twice §יב's first
#ASSERT `the further sum section 50 allocates to the loan fund` EQUALS 2 TIMES `the sum §יב of 12.9.95 set the loan fund up with`
#ASSERT `the loan fund section 50 funds serves` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the loan fund section 50 funds serves` TRUE TRUE
